<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89439" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσίζ-ω</span></b> , c. acc., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>come and sit near</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάγον</span>, of suppliants, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				189
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρτεμιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					935
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. περὶ τὰ βήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					564d
				</span></i>
			; <i>settle</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ μέλιττα πρὸς οὐδὲν π. σαπρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					596b15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τοῖς ἄνθεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					5.10.3
				</span></i>
			; <i>adhere to</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.95
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>cleave to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελέτημα π. τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					910.9
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγνώμονα ἀλλήλοισι γινώσκει πρὸς ὃ
					προσίζει: προσίζει γὰρ τὸ σύμφορον τῷ συμφόρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Vict.</u>
					1.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ προσίζουσα αἰτίη</span> the
				<i>inherent</i> cause, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.7
			</span></i>.</div>
